{"id":24005,"name":"记忆永不落幕","rarity":5,"path":"Memory","desc":"记忆命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"不论繁华的、荒凉的、短暂的、漫长的…每一颗星球，每一个瞬间皆在发生无数的事件。\\n那凝结的历史一触便融化于手中，化作泪水自世界的眼眸流淌而下——\\n\\n有人说，那是多么沉重的泪水，凝聚的岁月足以令永恒褪色。\\n有人说，那是多么美妙的故事，悲哀澄澈，欢悦明静，其间不夹杂一丝虚伪。\\n\\n银河静默流淌，祂不语，只是凝望——\\n凝望着，等待着它们成为「记忆」。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":24005,"name":"收取","desc":"使装备者的速度提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[f1]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放战技后，使我方全体造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，持续<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>回合。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.06,0.08,3]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.075,0.1,3]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.09,0.12,3]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.105,0.14,3]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.12,0.16,3]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":24,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":18,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":52.8,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":39.6,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110251,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111001,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":91.2,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":68.4,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110252,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":129.6,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":97.2,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110252,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":111002,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":168,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":126,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110253,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":111003,"ItemNum":6}]},"5":{"hp_base":412.8,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":206.4,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":154.8,"defence_add":2.7,"max_level":70,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":200000},{"ItemID":1